# INVWIN.KEY - a key script of INVWIN (SRC/WIN/INVWIN.C), run by make
# wintest on the data TEST/KEYS/SEED.REQ seeds: a login at level 3 with
# its menus, Find text's search dialog, the About box, the password
# dialog from the menu with a wrong old password, F10 opening the menu
# bar, as Windows has it, and the end by ALT-F4.  Every mode of Windows
# writes TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWIN.SNP.
S LOGIN
T admin
K TAB
T Retro1986
S TYPED
K ENTER
S ADMIN
# Search > Find text: the search dialog, which ESC leaves.
K ALT-S T
S FIND
K ESC
K ALT-H A
S ABOUT
K ENTER
# Options > Change password, refused in place: the old one is wrong.
K ALT-O P
S PASSWD
T Wrong1986
K TAB
T Admin1986
K TAB
T Admin1986
K ENTER
S OLDWRONG
K ESC
S BACK
# F10 is Windows' key of the menu bar, which ESC leaves; ALT-F4 quits.
K F10
S MENUBAR
K ESC ALT-F4
S GONE
